            <fr:title text="AllReduce is two collectives, not one">AllReduce is two collectives, not one</fr:title>
            <fr:taxon>Card</fr:taxon>
            <fr:meta name="anki">1786546736236</fr:meta>
            <fr:meta name="anki-deck">MLSys</fr:meta>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
  <html:p><fr:link href="/U351/" title="AllReduce" uri="https://kellenkanarios.com/U351/" display-uri="U351" type="local">AllReduce</fr:link>: signature, decomposition, and cost relative to an <fr:link href="/VSDZ/" title="AllGather" uri="https://kellenkanarios.com/VSDZ/" display-uri="VSDZ" type="local">AllGather</fr:link>?</html:p>
  
  
  
 <html:div class="jms-callout" style="
  margin: 1.1rem 0;
  padding: 0.1rem 0 0.1rem 0.9rem;
  border-left: 2px solid rgb(63, 83, 127);
  "><html:span style="font-weight: 500; color: rgb(63, 83, 127);" /> 
  <html:details><html:summary><html:span class="foldout" style="font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: 500; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);">Answer</html:span></html:summary>
  <html:strong>Signature</html:strong> <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[[A_X, B]\{U_Y\} \to  [A_X, B]]]></fr:tex> — it removes the "unreduced" suffix, leaving every device on the axis holding the same fully-summed value, unsharded along <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[Y]]></fr:tex>.

  <html:strong>It is not really a primitive</html:strong>: an AllReduce is a <fr:link href="/CAGW/" title="ReduceScatter" uri="https://kellenkanarios.com/CAGW/" display-uri="CAGW" type="local">ReduceScatter</fr:link> followed by an AllGather.

  <fr:tex display="block"><![CDATA[A[I_X, J]\{U_Y\} \xrightarrow {\ \mathrm {ReduceScatter}_{Y,J}\ } A[I_X, J_Y] \xrightarrow {\ \mathrm {AllGather}_Y\ } A[I_X, J]]]></fr:tex>

  <html:strong>Cost</html:strong> <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[2V / W_{\mathrm {ici}}]]></fr:tex>, exactly <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[2\times ]]></fr:tex> an AllGather — which is the practical argument for stopping at the ReduceScatter whenever the consumer can accept a sharded output. The AllGather can then be deferred, or skipped entirely.
</html:details>
</html:div>



</fr:mainmatter>
        </fr:tree>
        <fr:tree show-metadata="true" expanded="false" toc="false" numbered="false">
          <fr:frontmatter>
            <fr:authors>
              <fr:author>
                <fr:link href="/kellenkanarios/" title="Kellen Kanarios" uri="https://kellenkanarios.com/kellenkanarios/" display-uri="kellenkanarios" type="local">Kellen Kanarios</fr:link>
